{%- comment -%}
  Everything the Brevonnio page needs, loaded only on its own template.

  All of its CSS -- the inline head block and the theme stylesheets -- is rewritten
  under .bv-scope, a class every bv-* section carries via its schema, with
  html/body/:root mapped to the scope root rather than ".bv-scope html", which could
  never match.

  Dropped, not vendored: Shopify platform bundles (storefront, load_feature,
  shop_events_listener, webmcp) that lazily import chunks the capture never saw, and
  app scripts for apps this store does not run. The two kaching-subscriptions files
  are dropped because this store has that app embedded already.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% render 'bv-inline-css-1' %}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ 'bv-accelerated-checkout-backwards-compat.css' | asset_url }}" media="all">
