{%- comment -%}
  The source theme's element files are deliberately NOT loaded. All 33 custom elements
  it defines -- product-form, quantity-input, media-gallery, cart-drawer, search-form and
  the rest -- are already defined by this theme, so loading both throws
  "Identifier QuantityInput has already been declared" and kills the rest of the script.
  global.min.js goes with them: it re-declares subscribers. This theme hydrates the
  identical markup.

  Kept: the page's own logic -- the bundle/offer engine, the progressive gift monitor,
  Swiper and the sizing plugin -- none of which define custom elements.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script src="{{ 'bv-SizingPlugin.prod.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'bv-vendors.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'bv-bundle.min.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'bv-progressive-gift-monitor-standalone.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'bv-swiper-bundle.min.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{%- comment -%} bv-atc-colour {%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  The add-to-cart button took its colours from
    .bv-scope .button { background-color: rgb(var(--color-base-accent-3)); }
  which depends on a variable resolving. The client reported it rendering white with
  invisible text until hover, so the colours are stated outright here instead: solid
  black at rest, dark grey on hover, white label in both. !important because the
  source theme also sets these on :hover and we want one predictable answer.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
.bv-scope button[name="atlas-bundler-add"],
.bv-scope .atc-button,
.bv-scope .product-form-button{background-color:#000 !important;border-color:#000 !important;}
.bv-scope button[name="atlas-bundler-add"]:hover,
.bv-scope .atc-button:hover,
.bv-scope .product-form-button:hover,
.bv-scope button[name="atlas-bundler-add"]:focus,
.bv-scope .atc-button:focus{background-color:#333 !important;border-color:#333 !important;}
.bv-scope button[name="atlas-bundler-add"],
.bv-scope button[name="atlas-bundler-add"] *,
.bv-scope .atc-button,
.bv-scope .atc-button *,
.bv-scope .product-form-button,
.bv-scope .product-form-button *{color:#fff !important;}
</style>
